<title>UK: CSFB sets 750 mln French franc perpetual bond.</title>
<headline>CSFB sets 750 mln French franc perpetual bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced</p>
<p>by lead manager CSFB and BNP.</p>
<p> BORROWER   CREDIT SUISSE FIRST BOSTON (LONDON)</p>
<p> AMT    750 FFR	 COUPON    *6.50	MATURITY  **PERPETUAL</p>
<p> TYPE	 STEP-UP   ISS PRICE  99.62     PAY DATE    12.JUN.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  0.75	REOFFER    99.62     SPREAD	+83 BP</p>
<p> MOODY	A2	  LISTING    PARIS/LUX PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  A+	  DENOMS (K) 10-100-1M SALE LIMS US/UK/FR/CH</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   IPMA 2</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  =	   TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p>UNDERLYING GOVT BOND 10-YEAR OAT</p>
<p> NOTES	*FOR FIRST TEN YEARS THEN 3M PIBOR + 170 BP</p>
<p>	     **CALLABLE ON 12.JUN.07 AND INTEREST PAYMENTS</p>
<p>		 THEREAFTER.</p>
<p>		 SUBORDINATED.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
